Z||000000||GT Bastard||04-03-2001||09:56 PM||||Friend of mine just bought a '90 Pontiac 6000 AWD.  Yes, it's an AWD with a 3.1 V6.  Cool!!!!  It has ground effects and pimpin' wheels and everything...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  So after Fierogod fixes the cooling fan and a couple other odd & end things, they decide to go for a test drive.  I happened to leave at the same time and we ended up sitting at the same red light side-by-side.  How convenient you say?  I agree!  No cars ahead, none behind.  He launches in all-wheel-drive(looked like he was popping a wheelie with his really worn suspension.)  All through first gear we were almost dead-even(he had maybe 2ft. on me.  After second gear the GT started pulling ahead and I backed-off.  My GT isn't exactly a powerhouse, but that 6000 was pretty impressive!  I'm told that it's 1990 only.    ||||reg||14
